{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_05c3823377d183a77c704d3c247a32cb57cca1262f5ff7ca7c0c7e181c95261e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The OAMP retrofit pass records the package version as oracleagentmemory==26.4.0, and a pre-flight step confirms 26.4.0 or newer is installed."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0e9b5754e76d7cd505e34f455794b1cc88a10f00ff9cb3e9b1e862c181fa263f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented OAMP quirks include context_card.formatted_content being a byte-for-byte alias of content, batch-written messages sharing one timestamp, and RECORD_CHUNKS holding roughly 1.3 rows per message."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1d3a4b64f90b85a9a4bc4e3900aae8c865176dfef1947ee754749160244d23a5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A decision tree in oamp.md maps memory shapes to tools: OAMP for conversational per-user durable memory, OracleVS for fixed RAG corpora, OracleChatHistory for simple chat logs, and SQL tables for counters and audit trails."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6a13e834ba965d6387609918821a8da9eb651bb27f74492ccb32ecd76ce247ec"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A shared oamp_helpers module exposes make_oamp_client, make_oamp_thread, and add_turn convenience functions, with auto-extraction enabled only when OCI_GENAI_API_KEY is set, otherwise degrading to manual-add mode."},{"claim_ids":["clm_886a8211b7a533146c206af3c9510d614e8f8d73179a58f690d7bdbade760d8d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A documented OAMP issue (V4-OAMP-1): batched add_messages calls count as one event, so memory-extraction frequency triggers never fire; the fix is per-turn writes via an add_turn helper."}],"claim_ids":["clm_05c3823377d183a77c704d3c247a32cb57cca1262f5ff7ca7c0c7e181c95261e","clm_0e9b5754e76d7cd505e34f455794b1cc88a10f00ff9cb3e9b1e862c181fa263f","clm_1d3a4b64f90b85a9a4bc4e3900aae8c865176dfef1947ee754749160244d23a5","clm_6a13e834ba965d6387609918821a8da9eb651bb27f74492ccb32ecd76ce247ec","clm_886a8211b7a533146c206af3c9510d614e8f8d73179a58f690d7bdbade760d8d"],"created_at":"